Considering the allegations, this question can be considered in four broad categories as follows:
a) Misrepresentation regarding promoters;
b) Misrepresentation regarding networth;
c) Misrepresentation regarding appraisal and syndication of debt; and CBI Vs. M/s JLD & Ors. Judgment Dt. 13.07.2023 Page No. 247 of 405 d) Misrepresentation regarding previous allocation of coal blocks.

